--><rss xmlns:sparkle="http://www.andymatuschak.org/xml-namespaces/sparkle" version="2.0"><channel><title>AndroidADBTool 更新</title><language>zh-CN</language><item><title>AndroidADBTool 1.0.20</title><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 10:28:53 GMT</pubDate><sparkle:version>20261125182328</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.20</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>11.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><description>&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.6"&gt;截图保存成功后会提示保存路径，几秒后自动消失。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.6"&gt;打开工具时，如果上次选中的手机不在线，会自动选中当前已连接的手机。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.6"&gt;录屏时手机旋转或画面尺寸变化不再中断，画面保持在原来的画布里。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.6"&gt;极简模式不再显示埋点调试开关；应用相关第一项改为「打开应用」。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.6"&gt;日志页增加 gallery1、gallery2 包名快捷选择，采集中不能切换应用；双击可以选中完整日志字段。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;</description><enclosure url="https://github.com/zj-kechangjie/android_tool_plus-updates/releases/download/v1.0.20/AndroidADBTool-1.0.20-20261125182328-AppleSilicon.zip" length="53087823" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="jG57QrMNHwcp9N3l7M2COG7sdEAp994AGnUGHEQ1geXXGEB0KDm3Ur/C4QC/6WZkqWJrT9FpbfzEBeMUFkAsBw=="></enclosure><sparkle:deltas><enclosure url="https://github.com/zj-kechangjie/android_tool_plus-updates/releases/download/v1.0.20/AndroidADBTool-1.0.20-20261125182328-from-20261124182558-AppleSilicon.delta" length="1419650" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:deltaFrom="20261124182558" sparkle:edSignature="jgzK7pYrk4lSpLwUll9qNFzEJgSeZuhUGM7wZmppqoe1raG486JhhjElekXshtVN0eomdiDHIPxit8Clwoi+BQ==" sparkle:deltaFromSparkleExecutableSize="977616" sparkle:deltaFromSparkleLocales="Base,ar,ca,cs,da,de,el,es,fa,fi,fr,he,hr,hu,is,it,ja,ko,nb,nl,nn,pl,pt-BR,pt-PT,ro,ru,sk,sl,sv,th,tr,uk,vi,zh_CN,zh_HK,zh_TW"></enclosure><enclosure url="https://github.com/zj-kechangjie/android_tool_plus-updates/releases/